><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waves of enemies that grow more and more challenging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth gameplay with auto-aim for fluid control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability: every run is a brand-new challenge </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <i>Each run is a new challenge, a unique battle to fight, a journey where tenacity meets hope and where every choice helps forge the legend of Booby.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072080/extras/b6d8565da10fae180da06fcb719614f6.avif?t=1782419068\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "BoobyRogue: Tumor Takedown is a fast-paced 2D roguelite where you choose your hero and fight through waves of enemies in a symbolic battle against breast cancer. Collect weapons and items, create unique builds, and survive until the final Tumor.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072080/b56b4f37758a7901692717174efba8b8e9956a70/header.jpg?t=1782419068", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072080/a9ebafaa589877eaabab9629ebcfa025c3e77e69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782419068", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072080/a9ebafaa589877eaabab9629ebcfa025c3e77e69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782419068", "website": "https://k-nette.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windwos 10<br></li><li><stro